            <ArticleTitle>K/BxN serum transfer arthritis as a model of inflammatory joint pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>249-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/978-1-61779-561-9_19</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this chapter, we describe the usage of this rheumatoid arthritis model to investigate pain-like behavior in mice, including the assessment of clinical changes and the time-dependent changes in nociceptive behavior during disease progresses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
